{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"The writeback enable is now x0-qualified, and both read ports use only the qualified write-first mux over the physical register entry. I also added a pipeline-level timing case that distinguishes WB→ID bypass from nearer EX forwarding and checks an x0-destination cannot contaminate an x0 read."}}
